      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING PLUM (3) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at Healesville following on from a third place finish (19.82) there the start prior. Better than last start and worth following up. DARNUM RAIN (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 26.45 beating Wile Coyote. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has definite claims. MIGHTY HERCULES (5) chased the lead early from the inside draw but took over turning to score (26.37) at this track in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 over 460m. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Will go close again if runs up to latest. DR. CALISTA (2) cannot be left out despite racing here for the first time.",
